              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&apos;Customer chats are grouped into topics, based on following key words:&#10;&#10;Topic 1 - Expressing gratitude, order placement instructions&#10;please, thank, put, door, room, help, thanks, table, management, guard &#10;Topic 2 - Address instructions&#10;floor, send, lane, address, first, road, next, right, th, gate&#10;Topic 3 - Request to do sth, an issue&#10;call, hello, go, downstairs, wait, get, im, hard, work, trouble&apos;' />
