              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&apos;Customer chats are grouped into topics, based on following key words showing up together:&#10;&#10;Topic 1&#10;put, door, floor, room, thanks, help, management, table, send, first&#10;Topic 2&#10;number, house, account, send, soi, front, shop, alley, give, transfer&#10;Topic 3&#10;put, door, front, hang, house, help, table, locomotive, thanks, food&#10;Topic 4&#10;road, address, send, floor, lane, house, street, building, door, call&#10;Topic 5&#10;call, get, number, wait, go, help, thanks, downstairs, long, arrive&#10;&#10;&apos;' />
